    {
      "operation": "retire_thread/dispose_process registration storage",
      "owner": "outer composition, not the B runtime",
      "reason": "Current fields are installed in WOW32 initialization and cleared during disposal. Moving only the unbind invocation leaves lifecycle policy embedded in the B carrier. The complete patch must change registration, storage, consumers and initializer together; destination ABI still requires completing the initialization-chain cut."
    }
